{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/798031-blood-pool-idea","id":798031,"title":"Blood Pool idea","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-01-01T17:17:23-08:00","id":798031,"title":"Blood Pool idea","content":"So inspired by the idea in the book to hand out red chips or something for blood instead of tracking it in the character sheet. I've been using dice bags with a few dice mixed so the players have to weight the bag to determine how many blood points they have and not know for sure. <br /> <br /> Like when you're hungry you don't know that you need exactly 1000 calories you just know you're hungry for very hungry. <br /> <br /> So when they feed I drop red beads in their bag and when they loose them they take them out. It's affected how often they spend blood. They've all been a bit more stingy then they were before<br /> <br /> <br /> It's been very fun","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2191-kevorkiandoctor","name":"Kevorkiandoctor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"95"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-01T17:48:24-08:00","id":798039,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kevorkiandoctor</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/798031-blood-pool-idea#post798031\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So inspired by the idea in the book to hand out red chips or something for blood instead of tracking it in the character sheet. I've been using dice bags with a few dice mixed so the players have to weight the bag to determine how many blood points they have and not know for sure. <br /> <br /> Like when you're hungry you don't know that you need exactly 1000 calories you just know you're hungry for very hungry. <br /> <br /> So when they feed I drop red beads in their bag and when they loose them they take them out. It's affected how often they spend blood. They've all been a bit more stingy then they were before<br /> <br /> <br /> It's been very fun</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, that's a really neat idea! How do you decide modifiers for rolls to resist Frenzy? Just estimate, or do you secretly keep track of the actual numbers?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-02T03:17:12-08:00","id":798184,"title":"","content":"Should use chocolate chips! That way, when they get hungry, they can get more yummy food from the walking convience stores! *Cough* :P","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member",